{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12784","headline":"赠别成明府赴劒南 · 韩翃","name":"赠别成明府赴劒南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝爲三室印，晚爲三蜀人。\n遥知下车日，正及巴山春。\n县道橘花里，驿流江水滨。\n公门輙无事，赏地能相亲。\n解衣初醉绿芳夕，应采蹲鸱荐佳客。\n霁水远暎西川时，闲望碧鸡飞古祠。\n爱君乐事佳兴发，天外铜梁多梦思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}